WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with knees bent and feet on the floor, hands behind the thighs.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lean the torso back slightly and lift the shins parallel to the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Draw the low belly in and keep the chest lifted.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Option to release the hands and reach forward alongside the legs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold with even breath, then lower with control.
